menu "Cloudflare Tunnel (esp-cf-tunnel)"

    config CF_TUNNEL_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "Tunnel task stack size"
        default 8192
        help
            Stack of the task started by cft_tunnel_start(). Request handlers
            run in this task, so add what they need.

    config CF_TUNNEL_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Tunnel task priority"
        default 5

    config CF_TUNNEL_MIN_FREE_HEAP
        int "Minimum free heap for new requests"
        default 32768
        help
            While less heap than this is free, new requests are answered with
            503 instead of being served, so that the connections to the edge
            and the requests in progress keep working. 0 disables the check.

endmenu
